        <detaileddescription>
<para>When true (default) the local <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_task_scheduler" kindref="compound">TaskScheduler</ref> is started automatically whenever this node is elected leader, and stopped when leadership is transferred to another node.</para>
<para>Set to false if you want manual control via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_distributed_task_coordinator_1ae249522004964e58986761ca5c725c28" kindref="member">activateScheduler()</ref> / <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_distributed_task_coordinator_1a7df1c006cee4785c4d3044c9d1a11767" kindref="member">deactivateScheduler()</ref>. </para>
